WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.313
Step six: release or
restrain stored energy.

2
00:00:03.313 --> 00:00:07.303
Bleed air and hydraulic
pressure, block raised parts,

3
00:00:07.303 --> 00:00:10.540
let flywheels stop,
and let hot parts cool.

4
00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:16.488
Step seven: verify. Make sure everyone
is clear, then try to start the machine.

5
00:00:16.488 --> 00:00:18.144
Nothing should happen.

6
00:00:18.144 --> 00:00:23.791
If the procedure calls for a voltage
test, a qualified electrician does it.

7
00:00:23.791 --> 00:00:26.200
Then return the controls to off.

8
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:30.642
Only now is the machine at zero
energy and safe to work on.
